    "answer": {
      "short": "$(-1,2)$ and $(1,-2)$",
      "worked": "$\\begin{align*}f'(x)&=3x^2-3\\\\3x^2-3&=0\\\\x^2&=1\\\\x&=-1\\text{ or }1\\\\f(-1)&=(-1)^3-3(-1)\\\\f(-1)&=2\\\\f(1)&=1^3-3(1)\\\\f(1)&=-2\\end{align*}$\n\nThe points are $(-1,2)$ and $(1,-2)$.",
